---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Legal & Security | Haitao Zheng"
  description="Legal, privacy, and security posture for tzheng.dev."
>
  <article class="article-body">
    <span class="eyebrow">
      <span class="dot"></span>privacy-first static website / security note
    </span>
    <h1>Legal & Security.</h1>
    <section id="impressum">
      <h2>Impressum</h2>
      <p>
        This is a personal portfolio, engineering log, and learning website by
        Haitao Zheng.
      </p>
      <p>
        Contact:{" "}
        <a class="link" href="mailto:h@tzheng.dev">
          h@tzheng.dev
        </a>
      </p>
      <p>
        This page is a lightweight information page for a non-commercial
        personal site, not a legal service or business platform.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section id="datenschutz">
      <h2>Privacy & delivery</h2>
      <p>
        This domain is routed through Cloudflare nameservers, giving the site an
        edge layer for HTTPS delivery, DNS protection, caching, and basic abuse
        filtering before traffic reaches the static site.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site has no account system and adds no analytics or advertising
        scripts. GitHub Pages hosts the static files; Cloudflare provides the
        domain’s edge delivery. These providers may process request information,
        including IP addresses, for delivery and security. If you contact me by
        email, the information you send is used to handle your message.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Copyright & usage</h2>
      <p>
        Unless otherwise noted, the personal writing and presentation material
        on this site belong to Haitao Zheng.
      </p>
      <p>
        Referenced technologies, school names, logos, and GitHub projects remain
        the property of their respective owners.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
